"unresolved","note":"來源群體或未名者，不補人數/姓名、配偶或母親。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-022-luyu:p003:m0242","start":242,"end":244,"surface":"太祖","kind":"person","person_id":"dad_b77_b38","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-022-luyu:p003:m0245","start":245,"end":246,"surface":"毓","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"source_position":{"first_line":440,"last_line":454,"source_layer":"received_body","unit_key":"luyu-unit-03","raw_projection_ref":"source-evidence/sanguozhi022-luyu-projection.json"},"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-022-luyu","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-022","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-022-luyu"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-001-sima-near-ancestry","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-001","source_id":"s-jinshu-001-sima-near-ancestry","source":{"title":"《晉書》卷001（宣帝紀家世選段）","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2603565","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2603565","revision_id":2603565,"accessed_on":"2026-10-18","extent":"宣帝本紀傳首一原段；包含原稱遠祖說法，但非全本紀或全部帝室世系。","text_scope":"partial_chapter","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文及維基文庫數位轉錄；保留見證歸屬。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","edition":"維基文庫數位轉錄，底本影像未核","wikitext_sha256":"707b6117e29077a805763a4c1f1f074768f93768b80deace6223af9f93bfaa9a","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"extraction_note":"僅去段首排版空白及ref校注外殼；正文原字不改。ref內容另列later_critical_apparatus，不當作晉書正文人物。","excerpts":[{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-001-sima-near-ancestry:p001","source_lines":[11,11],"raw_quote":"　　宣皇帝諱懿，字仲達，河內溫縣孝敬里人，姓司馬氏。其先出自帝高陽之子重黎，為夏官祝融。歷唐、虞、夏、商，世序其職。及周，以夏官為司馬。其後程伯休父，周宣王時，以世官克平徐方，錫以官族，因而為氏。楚漢間，司馬卬為趙將，與諸侯伐秦。秦亡，立為殷王，都河內。漢以其地為郡，子孫遂家焉。自卬八世，生征西將軍鈞，字叔平。鈞生豫章太守量，字公度。量生潁川太守儁，字元異。儁生京兆尹防，字建公。帝即防之第二子也。少有奇節，聰朗多大略，博學洽聞，伏膺儒教。漢末大亂，常慨然有憂天下心。南陽太守同郡楊俊名知人，<ref>南陽太守同郡楊俊　「南陽」，各本皆作「南郡」。錢大昕《廿二史考異》{{*|以下簡稱考異}}：「魏志俊為南陽太守，非南郡。」今據改。</ref>見帝，未弱冠，以為非常之器。尚書清河崔琰與帝兄朗善，亦謂朗曰：「君弟聰亮明允，剛斷英特，非子所及也。」","raw_quote_sha256":"5575da666f9e169c2b0750e72d4cfc9419bd35cd77758dc9e36bd77c0396ef6b","selected_text_sha256":"c423833b1b98943bb19918e6ed6564f4d5c90ad401b61f8fa4f2fc20abd95026","begin_anchor":"宣皇帝諱懿，字仲達，河內溫縣孝","end_anchor":"明允，剛斷英特，非子所及也。」"}],"removed_apparatus":[{"text_layer":"later_critical_apparatus","source_line":11,"raw_note":"南陽太守同郡楊俊　「南陽」，各本皆作「南郡」。錢大昕《廿二史考異》{{*|以下簡稱考異}}：「魏志俊為南陽太守，非南郡。」今據改。","raw_note_sha256":"513ca7dcf0235998e3ab2871e1ba0f3821ae3c017af3c9a2e3e7a8acff1ed2b3","scope":"digital_note_reports_yangjun_commandery_variant","collated_by_current_agent":false}]}}},{"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-022-luyu","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-022","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-022-luyu","source":{"title":"三國志魏書卷二十二盧毓本傳及裴注完整單元","provider":"Kanripo","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kanripo/KR2a0012/214fcafa79894355909c9d8c2c1533089e7791c6/KR2a0012_022.txt","permalink":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kanripo/KR2a0012/214fcafa79894355909c9d8c2c1533089e7791c6/KR2a0012_022.txt","revision_id":"214fcafa79894355909c9d8c2c1533089e7791c6","source_commit":"214fcafa79894355909c9d8c2c1533089e7791c6","response_sha256":"3bac47f1f63c9556bc3b4087fda3cfb04f3470a267595521d236e22e58b00a3b","edition":"WYG數位轉錄，未核影像","accessed_on":"2026-10-22","extent":"固定原行432–505，盧毓本傳與兩處完整裴注（含盧植與子孫附敘）；431衛臻注尾及506起全卷評曰排除。","text_scope":"partial_chapter","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代正文，保留Kanripo數位轉錄歸屬。","license_url":"https://www.kanripo.org/","normalization":{"character_conversion":"none","extraction_note":"刪¶/換行與pb頁碼；括號只為古注逐行包裝，移為text_layer。原字（含珽/諶别傳/尸等）不改，逐字raw_positions固定。"},"quality_note":"沿既存固定WYG數位轉錄，未讀版本影像；本傳及古注保全不等同逐項生平已核。"}}],"time_policy":{"unknown_is_not_unbounded":true,"attestation_is_not_tenure":true,"date_expressions_are_not_normalized":false,"date_normalization_coverage":"partial","normalized_year_numbering":"astronomical","civil_year_label_field":"chinese_civil_year","civil_year_label_coverage":"partial","regnal_year_cross